claim.claim-text:
(i) the first fragment is a toxin A repeating domain fragment;
(ii) the second fragment is a toxin B repeating domain fragment;
(iii) the first fragment has a first proximal end;
(iv) the second fragment has a second proximal end; and
wherein the first fragment and the second fragment are adjacent to one another and wherein the polypeptide elicits antibodies that neutralize toxin A or toxin B or both.
